# Runs against the staged demo bundle (scripts/fixtures/flashcards). The
# missing/corrupt-collection paths are covered by check-flashcards-companion.
wait 800
expect Flashcards
expect Nature Notes
clean
shot decks

tap-id deck-0
wait-for-id answer
expect What does a compass point toward?
clean
shot question

tap-id answer
wait-for-id good
expect Magnetic north.
clean
shot answer

tap-id good
wait 1000
wait-for-id answer
clean
shot next-card
